    {
      "number": 32,
      "category": "",
      "title": "元明帝后妃與鄭阿春家世選段",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:xun-lady-care:p001",
      "count": 2,
      "quote": "薄。及明帝即位，封建安君，別立第宅。太寧元年，帝迎還臺內，供奉隆厚。及成帝立，尊重同于太后。咸康元年薨。詔曰：「朕少遭憫凶，慈訓無稟，撫育之勤，建安君之仁也。一旦薨殂，實思報復，永惟平昔，感痛哀摧。其贈豫章郡君，別立廟于京都。」",
      "work_id": "w-jinshu",
      "book_id": "b-jinshu-032",
      "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family",
      "source_id": "s-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family",
      "work_title": "晉書",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:xun-lady-care:p001"
      ],
      "mention_ids": [
        "c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:xun-lady-care:p001:m0086",
        "c-jinshu-032-zheng-achun-family:xun-lady-care:p001:m0107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 75,
      "category": "",
      "title": "荀崧及荀蕤、荀羨傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-146:p001",
      "count": 4,
      "quote": "蘇峻之役，崧與王導、陸曄共登御床擁衛帝，及帝被逼幸石頭，崧亦侍從不離帝側。賊平，帝幸溫嶠舟，崧時年老病篤，猶力步而從。咸和三年薨，時年六十七。贈侍中，諡曰敬。",
      "work_id": "w-jinshu",
      "book_id": "b-jinshu-075",
      "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families",
      "source_id": "s-jinshu-075-xunsong-families",
      "work_title": "晉書",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-146:p001"
      ],
      "mention_ids": [
        "c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-146:p001:m0018",
        "c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-146:p001:m0021",
        "c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-146:p001:m0034",
        "c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-146:p001:m0040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 76,
      "category": "",
      "title": "王彪之傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-076-wangbiaozhi:line087",
      "count": 1,
      "quote": "室，彪之曰：「中興初，即位東府，殊為儉陋，元明二帝亦不改制。蘇峻之亂，成帝止蘭台都坐，殆不蔽寒暑，是以更營修築。方之漢魏，誠為儉狹，復不至陋，殆合豐約之中，今自可隨宜增益修補而已。強寇未殄，正是休兵養士之時，何可大興功力，勞擾百姓邪！」安曰：「宮室不壯，後世謂人無能。」彪之",
      "work_id": "w-jinshu",
      "book_id": "b-jinshu-076",
      "chapter_id": "c-jinshu-076-wangbiaozhi",
      "source_id": "s-jinshu-076-wangbiaozhi",
      "work_title": "晉書",
